text:
@bot can now connect to private MCP servers on your tailnet without exposing them to the public internet.

Powered by Tailscale OAuth apps, now GA, so you can build secure agent integrations, too.

Read more here: [buff.ly/U1J9By1](https://buff.ly/U1J9By1)

iPhoneに「Hey Grok」ていうと
Grokと電話できるように設定できるらしい！！

